  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses the three key barriers for on and off-farm businesses of people with disabilities in rural Malawi; access to skills (agricultural extension and business development advisory services); access to markets; and, critically, access to finance (credit).</narrative>
